  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large saucepan over medium heat",
    "Add the onion and scotch bonnet pepper and cook until the onion is translucent",
    "Add the curry powder, thyme, and allspice and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add the lentils, coconut milk, salt, and pepper and bring to a boil",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes or until the lentils are tender",
    "Preheat the hot stone plate over high heat",
    "Add the lentil mixture to the hot stone plate and cook for 2 minutes or until charred",
    "Stir the lentil mixture and cook for an additional 2 minutes or until the desired level of char is achieved"
